{"id":"npc:%E6%9F%A5%E5%BE%B7","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"凯尔希小队成员。被妻子和女儿抛弃。在面对地下能源区的牧群和石棺周围的高浓度源石粉尘时失去了信心，但被凯尔希鼓舞，振作了起来。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情M8-7 恶言，报应不爽，黑角干员密录-甲板另一侧、香草干员密录-源石虫与啤酒花。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_090.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_090.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_090.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_089.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_089.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_089.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_08-12_end","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":31,"line":32,"speaker":"查德","text":"医生你还记得挺牢，但你记错了，老婆女儿都不要我了。我没有家。"},{"commandIndex":35,"line":36,"speaker":"查德","text":"做梦倒是有做过。"},{"commandIndex":42,"line":43,"speaker":"查德","text":"都听你的，医生。"}]}]}